</problem>
</exercise>
<para id="fs-id1170654142595"><emphasis effect="bold">દશાંશ સંખ્યાઓ, અપૂર્ણાંકો અને ટકાનું રૂપાંતર કરો</emphasis></para>
<para id="fs-id1166422822014">નીચેના અભ્યાસોમાં દરેક દશાંશ સંખ્યાને અપૂર્ણાંક તરીકે લખો.</para>
<exercise id="fs-id1170654142602">
<problem id="fs-id1170654142604">
<para id="fs-id1170652630502">0.08</para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1170652630507">
<para id="fs-id1170652630509"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mfrac><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mrow><m:mn>25</m:mn></m:mrow></m:mfrac></m:mrow></m:math>
</para>
</solution>
</exercise>
<exercise id="fs-id1170653791822">
<problem id="fs-id1170653791824">
<para id="fs-id1170653791826">0.17</para>
</problem>
</exercise>
<exercise id="fs-id1170652676531">
<problem id="fs-id1170652676533">
<para id="fs-id1170652676535">0.425</para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1170652676540">
<para id="fs-id1170652676542"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mfrac><m:mrow><m:mn>17</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mrow><m:mn>40</m:mn></m:mrow></m:mfrac></m:mrow></m:math>
</para>
</solution>
</exercise>
<exercise id="fs-id1170654203617">
<problem id="fs-id1170654203619">
<para id="fs-id1170654203621">0.184</para>
</problem>
</exercise>
<exercise id="fs-id1170654143035">
<problem id="fs-id1170654143037">
<para id="fs-id1170654143039">1.75</para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1170653773449">
<para id="fs-id1170653773451"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mfrac><m:mn>7</m:mn><m:mn>4</m:mn></m:mfrac></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</solution>
</exercise>
<exercise id="fs-id1170653773463">
<problem id="fs-id1170653773465">
<para id="fs-id1170653773467">0.035</para>
</problem>
</exercise>
<para id="fs-id1170652622284">નીચેના અભ્યાસોમાં દરેક અપૂર્ણાંકને દશાંશ સંખ્યામાં ફેરવો.</para>
